//puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Cavalry","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Tania","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Hero_Bond"],notes:["Unit type Cavalry is your in-game correction and is confirmed by the wiki Cavalry and Heroes pages.","Element corrected Light -> Ice (wiki Heroes table and Tania page).","Match-3 skills from the wiki: Allegro of Life (restores 44% HP to all allies), Watershield (all allies DEF +63% for 5 rounds, unlocks Lv. 11), Moisture (dispels all debuffs on allies, Lv. 31). The skill level for the 44%/63% values is not stated.","Role text 'Cavalry Support' comes from your hosted data pack and is kept.","In-game (2026-11-23, Tania at +5): element Ice and Cavalry confirmed; troop skill 500% of troop ATK; Cavalry HP/DEF/ATK tables 5\u2605 32/48/64/80/100/115/188% (+2 to +8), 6\u2605 100/128/150/250% (+5 to +8); hero skills Allegro of Life (Rage Regen Medium), Watershield, Moisture, Elegy, Iron Will (6\u2605, Crit Res. +30%). The unsourced Volley Command and Thunder Mark skills were replaced.","Bond corrected: Octet Wanderers.","Unconfirmed acquisition sources: Timeless Recruitment."]},dimina:{checkedOn:'2026-11-23',verified:["name","element","unitType","rarity","sources"],sourceUrls:["https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Heroes","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Cavalry"],notes:["Wiki: 5-star Nature Cavalry, Glory's Gift Roulette (app previously: Light Archer)."]},kanye:{checkedOn:'2026-11-23',verified:["name","element","unitType"],sourceUrls:["https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Heroes","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Archer"],notes:["Wiki: Fire Archer (app previously: Cavalry). Star rating not stated in the extracts.","Unconfirmed acquisition sources: Glory's Gift Roulette.","Star rating not stated in the sources checked; existing value kept."]},norris:{checkedOn:'2026-11-23',verified:["name","element","unitType","bondGroups"],sourceUrls:["https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Heroes","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Archer","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Hero_Bond"],notes:["Wiki: Fire Archer (app previously: Ice Infantry). Star rating not stated. Bond corrected: Sanguine Serenade.","In-game (2026-11-24, Norris at +3, bond 8): 5\u2605 Fire Archer confirmed; troop skill 200% of troop ATK; Archer HP/DEF/ATK use the standard 5\u2605/6\u2605 table (Archer DEF unlocks at Lv. 31, Archer ATK at Lv. 131); hero skills Bloody Praise (170% to all enemies + Burn, Rage Regen Medium), Fatal Gaze (Lv. 11), Crimson Realm (Lv. 31), Blood Rush (Lv. 71), Combat Mastery (6\u2605). The unsourced tank skills (Shield Wall, Permafrost Guard) were replaced.","Unconfirmed acquisition sources: Arms Race Ace Card.","Star rating not stated in the sources checked; existing value kept."]},edith:{checkedOn:'2026-11-23',verified:["name","element","unitType","rarity","bondGroups"],sourceUrls:["https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Heroes","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Archer","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Hero_Bond"],notes:["Wiki: 5-star Ice Archer (app previously: Nature Infantry). Bond corrected: Sanguine Serenade.","In-game (2026-11-23, Edith at +2): Ice Archer confirmed; troop skill 150% of troop ATK; Archer HP/DEF/ATK use the standard 5\u2605/6\u2605 table (Archer ATK unlocks at Lv. 131); hero skills Desperate Spike (183% to all enemies, Rage Regen Medium), Wraith Within, Bleak Whispers, Spiritual Shriek (Lv. 71), Combat Mastery (6\u2605). The unsourced healer/tank skills (Field Medic, Overgrowth) and the tank role were replaced.","Unconfirmed acquisition sources: Strike Out, Timeless Recruitment."]},boyd:{checkedOn:'2026-11-23',verified:["name","element","unitType","rarity","sources"],sourceUrls:["https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Heroes","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Cavalry"],notes:["Wiki: 5-star Nature Cavalry from Ace Lord (app previously: Fire).","In-game (2026-11-23, Boyd at +4): Nature and Cavalry confirmed; troop skill 300% of troop ATK; Cavalry HP/DEF/ATK use the standard 5\u2605/6\u2605 table; hero skills Claw of Void (530%, Rage Regen Medium), Strength Absorption, Self-healing Instinct, Cold Blood, Target Weakness (6\u2605). The unsourced fire-themed skills (Burning Hooves, Flame Charge) were replaced. His title 'Ember Captain' is not verified."]},monica:{checkedOn:'2026-11-23',verified:["name","element","unitType","rarity"],sourceUrls:["https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Heroes","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Monica"],notes:["In-game (2026-11-24, Monica 6\u2605 +8): Dark Civil confirmed; troop skill 500%; Castle Battle HP/DEF/ATK (Passive, while owned, when fighting in castle) 5\u2605 30\u2013169%, 6\u2605 95/120/135/225%; hero skills Deadly Phantom (360%), Twisted Spirit, Heartbreak Moment, Energy Extraction, Combat Mastery (6\u2605). The unsourced Radiant Lance / Dawn Pierce skills were replaced.","Wiki: 5-star Dark Civil (app previously: Light Cavalry).","Unconfirmed acquisition sources: Ace Lord Radiant Card."]},kaios:{checkedOn:'2026-11-23',verified:["name","element","unitType","sources","rarity"],sourceUrls:["https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Heroes","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Kaios","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Cavalry","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Archer"],notes:["Second in-game check (2026-11-24, Kaios 6\u2605 +8): Infantry/Cavalry/Archer HP (Passive) +200% each, matching the stored 6\u2605 table; Temporal Rift 390% at 6\u2605 +8 (330% at Hero0); main skill capped at 500%.","In-game (2026-11-23, Kaios at Hero0, S1 badge): Light Civil confirmed; troop skill 100% of troop ATK; Infantry, Cavalry and Archer HP (Passive, active while owned; Archer HP unlocks at Lv. 131) 5\u2605 12% at Hero0, 24/36/48/60/75/90/150% (+2 to +8), 6\u2605 75/90/120/200%; hero skills Temporal Rift, Time Cage, Back to the Past, Cycle of Rebirth (Lv. 71), Combat Mastery (6\u2605). The unsourced Undertow / Riptide skills were replaced.","Wiki: Light Civil; Ace Lord (servers open more than 12 weeks) and AP Event (app previously: Ice Archer).","Wiki lists Kaios under \"other heroes with Cavalry/Archer skills\" \u2014 his skills affect troop types other than his unit type.","5\u2605 confirmed from an in-game hero list (2026-11-23)."]},aerposia:{checkedOn:'2026-11-23',verified:["name","element","unitType","rarity","sources"],sourceUrls:["https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Heroes","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Cavalry"],notes:["Wiki: 5-star Dark Cavalry from Ace Lord (app previously: Light Archer)."]},valerius:{checkedOn:'2026-11-23',verified:["name","element","unitType","rarity","sources"],sourceUrls:["https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Heroes","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/All-round","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Hero_Bond"],notes:["Wiki: 5-star Nature All-round; purchase or Astrology (app previously: Fire Infantry).","Not listed in Sanguine Serenade on the Hero Bond page; removed from that group."]},tala:{checkedOn:'2026-11-23',verified:["name","element","unitType","rarity","sources"],sourceUrls:["https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Heroes"],notes:["Wiki: 5-star Nature Civil, Astrology (app previously: Archer)."]},eris:{checkedOn:'2026-11-23',verified:["name","element","unitType","rarity","bondGroups"],sourceUrls:["https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Heroes","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Cavalry","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Hero_Bond"],notes:["Wiki: 5-star Dark Cavalry (matches app). Bond corrected: Sanguine Serenade. Sources partly ambiguous in the extract (shared sentence with Eric).","In-game (2026-11-23, Eris at +3): Dark and Cavalry confirmed; troop skill 200% of troop ATK; Troop HP/DEF/ATK (all troops) 5\u2605 12.8/19.2/25.6/32/40/51.2/94% (+2 to +8), 6\u2605 40/51.2/75/125% (+5 to +8); hero skills Void Oblivion (220% to all enemies, Rage Regen Slow), Distracted Mind, Fiend's Rage, Descent of Fear, Combat Mastery (6\u2605). The unsourced Sow Discord / Apple of Strife (Silence) skills were replaced.","Unconfirmed acquisition sources: Recruit Trial, Timeless Recruitment."]},"kujo-mamoru":{checkedOn:'2026-11-23',verified:["name","element","unitType","rarity","bondGroups"],sourceUrls:["https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Heroes","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Infantry","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Hero_Bond"],notes:["Wiki: 5-star Nature Infantry (app previously: Light). Bond corrected: Rhapsody of Genesis.","In-game (2026-11-23, Kujo Mamoru at +2): Nature Infantry confirmed; troop skill 150% of troop ATK; Infantry HP/DEF/ATK use the standard 5\u2605/6\u2605 table (Infantry ATK unlocks at Lv. 131); hero skills Zoetic Enchantment (Rage Regen Slow), Disarm, Traceless Shadow, Elf's Shelter (Lv. 71), Unbending (6\u2605). Commander Shop sells his shards (5,000, unlimited). The unsourced Sacred Barrier / Torii Seal skills were replaced.","Unconfirmed acquisition sources: Strike Out, Timeless Recruitment."]},rodriguez:{checkedOn:'2026-11-23',verified:["name","element","unitType","rarity","bondGroups"],sourceUrls:["https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Heroes","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Infantry","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Hero_Bond"],notes:["In-game (2026-11-24, Rodriguez at +1): 5\u2605 Light Infantry confirmed; troop skill 120% of troop ATK; Troop HP/DEF/ATK (all troops) table, 9.6% at +1 (Troop DEF Lv. 31, Troop ATK Lv. 131); hero skills Pledge of Victory (allies ATK +70%, Hit \u221235%), Art of Command (Lv. 11), Kingly Prowess (Lv. 31), Faith Deprivation (Lv. 71), Unbending (6\u2605). Matches the Sophia answer: Rodriguez cannot reduce enemy DEF. The unsourced Powder Keg / Dynamite skills were replaced.","Wiki: 5-star Light Infantry; Hero Plaza, Mythic Hero Covenant and other sources (app previously: Fire Archer).","Previous app sources (Personal Activity, Recruit Trial, Timeless Recruitment) kept but not confirmed. Bond corrected: Rhapsody of Genesis.","Unconfirmed acquisition sources: Personal Activity, Recruit Trial, Timeless Recruitment."]},freya:{checkedOn:'2026-11-23',verified:["name","element","unitType","rarity","bondGroups"],sourceUrls:["https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Heroes","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Archer","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Hero_Bond"],notes:["In-game (2026-11-24, Freya at +2, bond 6): 5\u2605 Nature Archer confirmed; troop skill 150% of troop ATK; Troop HP/DEF/ATK (all troops) table, Troop DEF unlocks at Lv. 31 and Troop ATK at Lv. 131; hero skills Quaking Shot (300% + Stun, Rage Regen Medium), Shield Erosion (Lv. 11), Will of Elf (Lv. 31), Vigor of Cosmos (Lv. 71), Target Weakness (6\u2605). The unsourced Valhalla Ride / Einherjar skills were replaced.","Wiki: 5-star Nature Archer; several sources incl. Lucky Spin (app previously: Ice Cavalry). Bond corrected: Rhapsody of Genesis.","Unconfirmed acquisition sources: Recruit Trial, Timeless Recruitment."]},fiona:{checkedOn:'2026-11-23',verified:["name","element","unitType","rarity","bondGroups"],sourceUrls:["https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Heroes","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Fiona","https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Hero_Bond"],notes:["Wiki: 5-star Fire Civil (app previously: Nature All-round). Bond corrected: Octet Wanderers.","In-game (2026-11-23, Fiona at +1): Fire Civil confirmed; troop skill 120% of troop ATK; Training Speed, Stamina Cost Down and Training Cost Down (Lv. 131) tables for 5\u2605 and 6\u2605; hero skills Inferno Breath (161% to all enemies, Rage Regen Slow), Draconic Flames, Drake Companion, Sunset Explosion (Lv. 71), Combat Mastery (6\u2605, Crit +30%). The unsourced Verdant Aura / Bloom healer skills were replaced.","Wiki shows a Legion Attribute of Troop DEF +12% / Troop HP +12% (level not stated); not added as a skill.","Unconfirmed acquisition sources: Timeless Recruitment."]},carvell:{checkedOn:'2026-11-23',verified:["name","element","unitType","rarity","bondGroups"],sourceUrls:["https://puzzles-chaos.fandom.com/wiki/Heroes","http